      },
      {
        "heading": "Who are Thundercat Technology's top customers and markets?",
        "body": "Thundercat Technology's top buying agency for FY2027 to date is the Department of Veterans Affairs with $150M. Thundercat Technology also sold to the National Aeronautics and Space Administration for $8.1M and the Department of Agriculture for $5.6M, and Other Computer Related Services is the top NAICS market with $169M. Thundercat Technology recorded $0 in obligations in Software Publishers for FY2027 to date."
      }
